  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "GUID Version 7 Extension v10.0.3 - Enterprise DDD Implementation\n\n            🆕 FEATURES:\n            - RFC 9562 compliant GUID V7 using .NET 10 native Guid.CreateVersion7()\n            - Automatic generation for BaseEntity<Guid> and AggregateRoot<Guid>\n            - Fluent configuration: WithGuidV7() extension method\n            - Custom timestamp provider support for deterministic generation\n            - Zero external dependencies\n\n            🏭 ENTERPRISE PRODUCTION FEATURES:\n            - Optimal database performance with timestamp-based sequential ordering\n            - Universal GUID ecosystem compatibility across microservices\n            - Full DDD compatibility with Domain Events and Value Objects\n\n            REQUIREMENTS:\n            - .NET 10+ for native Guid.CreateVersion7() support\n            - Compatible with FS.EntityFramework.Library v10.0.3+",
